          "width": 1400,
          "height": 900,
          "sha256": "f5a59b9c942fd429a9d643dff7ea9770f33cffdf280d8ce23891f4b53bdca792",
          "captionSourceHash": "f896937a43b07a38ca07ff88bd528a8b4099baee7cc990a3785a89de2a7999de"
        },
        "matchingReviewedOverrideProofs": [
          "docs/ssw-workspace/manufacturing/illustration-reading-reviewed-overrides/incoming-context179.json"
        ]
      },
      {
        "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-023",
        "sourceWeek": 4,
        "sourceJapanese": "試験名と液・試料条件を記録する。\n方法が違う時間を単純比較しない。\n耐食性試験の時間は実使用寿命そのものではない。",
        "sourceHash": "c68c6b0c18d9e9705e4dd62e62597e1cb2f16d0c146d7bdb7adf61ca696b7967",
        "asset": {
          "assetId": "mfg40-surface-023",
          "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/surface/surface-023.png",
          "width": 1400,
          "height": 900,
          "sha256": "31b708538adfd99f8cda4f2b722ebde8e31171a5710498bf390eb7413942e9af",
          "captionSourceHash": "c3b350499303dc0ca9eafcb998036d43124374daba258d17d93f4c4e6a34009f"
        },
        "matchingReviewedOverrideProofs": [
          "docs/ssw-workspace/manufacturing/illustration-reading-reviewed-overrides/incoming-context179.json"
        ]
      },
      {
        "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-024",
        "sourceWeek": 4,
        "sourceJapanese": "見本の種類と対象を確認する。\n照明・背景・角度をそろえる。\n外観や色が合っても別の性能試験は省略しない。",
        "sourceHash": "bf4e0da0d0fa1e1a6a10577bb0b289b98209af70e116732b2efd36601c7d2a98",
        "asset": {
          "assetId": "mfg-royal-week04-surface-day24-controlled-light-comparison",
