          "width": 1536,
          "height": 1024,
          "sha256": "7724118be390efbe967532d587c6c46a59b41858c250fb5f4b557357133b5d7a",
          "captionSourceHash": "20cca2a80f34ad889ff68f67c2de0a77b5a0de9cd70f3493d2885da3d58fb4db"
        },
        "matchingReviewedOverrideProofs": [
          "docs/ssw-workspace/manufacturing/illustration-reading-reviewed-overrides/incoming-context179.json"
        ]
      },
      {
        "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-025",
        "sourceWeek": 4,
        "sourceJapanese": "融点と許容使用温度は同じではない。\n導電率だけで接続全体の抵抗は決まらない。\n代表値は仕様と条件を確認して使う。",
        "sourceHash": "0c8d9fdcaeeb19f96f6abb07643cad182c3a1a88dc5534380b3882d7aa04aa0e",
        "asset": {
          "assetId": "mfg40-surface-025",
          "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/surface/surface-025.png",
          "width": 1400,
          "height": 900,
          "sha256": "f66803b3edc1043afea0136c7ac20252bdd74efe02efb41c7af5090889af7561",
          "captionSourceHash": "76d4ad31849c5ab4e8c4ef306e3b30f1c859a7a751f7da579ea278ee404ccdc8"
        },
        "matchingReviewedOverrideProofs": [
          "docs/ssw-workspace/manufacturing/illustration-reading-reviewed-overrides/incoming-context179.json"
        ]
      },
      {
        "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-026",
        "sourceWeek": 4,
        "sourceJapanese": "治具は固定と通電の両面を確認する。\nマスキングは範囲と材料適合を守る。\n槽材の適合は薬液・温度などの条件で判断する。",
        "sourceHash": "a77fcbeb8fdf745f1f0349170adb6f017c699a694e154e8a86836a089f9b0dc5",
        "asset": {
          "assetId": "mfg-royal-week04-surface-day26-masking-material-hold",
